OL,3,ASchool 'deeply saddened' by death of
OL,4,Afamily in sea off Shoreham
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school attended by a 14-year-old girl
OL,7,Fwho died alongside her father and
OL,8,Fmother after getting into difficulty in
OL,9,Fwater off the coast of Shoreham-by-Sea
OL,10,Fhas paid tribute to her.
OL,12,FSara El-Khawas and her parents, husband
OL,13,Fand wife Hassan El-Khawas, 55, and
OL,14,FZeina Alayn, 37, are believed to have
OL,15,Fgone into the water near Shoreham Fort
OL,16,Fin West Sussex on Tuesday, according to
OL,17,FSussex Police.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
