OL,3,ASchool 'deeply saddened' by death of
OL,4,Afamily in sea off Shoreham
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement on its website, the
OL,7,FEllen Wilkinson School for Girls in
OL,8,FEaling, west London, described Sara as
OL,9,Fa "sweet girl, well-liked by staff and
OL,10,Fstudents".
OL,12,FA fourth member of the family, a
OL,13,Fyounger girl, remains in hospital in a
OL,14,Fcritical condition, police confirmed on
OL,15,FThursday.
